From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hjviewer <haejin.cho@yonsei.ac.kr>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 03:07:05 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 112/162] hjviewer: the About screen reads the administrator's
 contact from hjv-admin-contact (I-1)

Words lane I-1 (critic X-13): _aboutLines() takes the contact from
hjvAdminContact(), the same main_get_common key the accept window, P2 and
P3 read. It still reads the update model inside the Obx so that a new
policy redraws the line.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 flutter/lib/common/hjviewer_account.dart | 13 +++++++++----
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/flutter/lib/common/hjviewer_account.dart b/flutter/lib/common/hjviewer_account.dart
index 0d41a15..436c38e 100644
--- a/flutter/lib/common/hjviewer_account.dart
+++ b/flutter/lib/common/hjviewer_account.dart
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@ import 'dart:convert';
 import 'package:flutter/material.dart';
 import 'package:flutter_hbb/common.dart';
 import 'package:flutter_hbb/common/formatter/id_formatter.dart';
+import 'package:flutter_hbb/common/hjv_admin_contact.dart';
 import 'package:flutter_hbb/common/hjv_style.dart';
 import 'package:flutter_hbb/common/hjv_update.dart';
 import 'package:flutter_hbb/common/hjviewer_access.dart';
@@ -197,10 +198,14 @@ List<Widget> hjvLoginPilot() => _accountBuild
       ]
     : [];
 
-/// The About screen's notice: with the contact of the policy this app trusts (U34), which the
-/// update model has from the core (hjv_update.dart); read inside an Obx, it follows a new policy.
-List<String> _aboutLines() => hjvAboutNoticeLines(_t,
-    accountBuild: _accountBuild, contact: hjvUpdate.value.contact);
+/// The About screen's notice: with the contact of the policy this app trusts (U34), the one the
+/// accept window and P2/P3 show (hjv_admin_contact.dart).
+List<String> _aboutLines() {
+  // read inside an Obx: the update model (hjv_update.dart) redraws it for a new policy
+  hjvUpdate.value;
+  return hjvAboutNoticeLines(_t,
+      accountBuild: _accountBuild, contact: hjvAdminContact());
+}
 
 /// D13 (desktop settings, About): who makes HJViewer and, in an account build, who the
 /// administrator is and the pilot notice.
